Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:17.46,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HAA81F0&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H552D5A&}Ghost Meets Gal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I can't believe we got the same room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm so relieved!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This has gotta be fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.62,0:00:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, it's a bit embarrassing,\Nbut you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hyped!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Dra-Em is like, really dry, which makes\Ntaking care of my skin such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.26,0:00:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? But your skin is so shiny, Santhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.78,0:00:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun protection is a must for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Alestiel\NDorm Leader
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening.\NI'm Alestiel, your dorm leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(421,781)\c&H16151B&\2c&HB78DBC&\3c&HC8B796&\4c&HB78DBC&}Alestiel\NDorm Leader
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't disappear, Lubnacchi. \NThere, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for dropping in so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.06,0:00:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just going around\Nexplaining the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so? Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.65,0:01:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, so you're the rumored honor student.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.70,0:01:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.10,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Santhi, you're an honor student?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, like, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.58,0:01:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,An honor student? So she's exceptional?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.50,0:01:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She's going to leave me behind\Nand debut at top speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Her popularity will skyrocket.\NShe'll be a huge hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.94,0:01:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A top idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll probably forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.94,0:01:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Santhi, congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.14,0:01:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, who were you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.78,0:01:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll end up dying alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.74,0:01:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot I was a Ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Each floor takes out its trash together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.64,0:01:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha~
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.56,0:01:51.20,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HAA81F0&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H552D5A&}Looking down, sighing, \Nhiding my true feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:53.65,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HAA81F0&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H552D5A&}Every time i step forward, \Neven if i'm trembling,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:56.50,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HAA81F0&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H552D5A&}I can't lie to my desire of change!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:59.30,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HAA81F0&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H552D5A&}It's surely a distant dream right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:01.79,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HAA81F0&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H552D5A&}but i want to chase it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:05.16,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HAA81F0&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H552D5A&}Even if our futures are different colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:08.18,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HAA81F0&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H552D5A&}Let's paint them with the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:12.70,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HAA81F0&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H552D5A&}Because you are the one who gives me courage!
